2026-08-25  Cursor Agent  <agent@cursor>

        Reoptimize sooner on InadequateCoverage OSR exits.
        https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=XXXXX

        InadequateCoverage exits are produced by ForceOSRExit for bytecode that
        had no value-profile coverage. Once that path is hot, every execution
        exits until reoptimization. Counting them toward the generic
        osrExitCountForReoptimization (~100) delays phase-change recovery.
        Use osrExitCountForReoptimizationFromLoop (default 5) instead.

        * dfg/DFGOSRExitCompilerCommon.cpp:
        (JSC::DFG::handleExitCounts):
        * dfg/DFGOperations.cpp:
        (JSC::DFG::operationTriggerReoptimizationNow):
